  "notes": "Ley 26.206 lets each jurisdiction choose 6 years of primary + 6 of secondary or 7 + 5; this file is the 6+6 structure (Buenos Aires province, Córdoba, Tucumán and 9 others) and AR-75 the 7+5 one (CABA, Santa Fe, Mendoza and 9 others). CFE Res. 84/09 sets the Ciclo Básico at 2 or 3 years depending on where 7th year sits, so 3 years (1°–3° año) here; the Ley simple page says 2 years in general. Technical secondary adds one year (7° año), not listed."
